Environment Setup — Complete List
1.	Install Anaconda or Miniconda
2.	Create a new conda environment with Python 3.10
3.	Activate the environment
4.	Install PyTorch with CUDA 12.1 support
5.	Install core computer vision libraries — OpenCV and MediaPipe
6.	Install training libraries — NumPy, scikit-learn, Matplotlib, Seaborn, Pillow, tqdm
7.	Install API libraries — FastAPI, Uvicorn, python-multipart
8.	Install speech libraries — SpeechRecognition, gTTS, pygame, pydub
9.	Install OpenAI Whisper from GitHub source
10.	Install dataset tools — Kaggle API, kagglehub
11.	Install utility libraries — python-dotenv, aiofiles
12.	Install Ollama from official website — Windows installer
13.	Pull lightweight LLM model via Ollama — recommended llama3.2 or phi3-mini
14.	Install Ollama Python client library
15.	Verify GPU is recognized by PyTorch
16.	Verify all libraries imported successfully
